The Sand is a horror, science fiction, comedy film directed by Isaac Gabaeff.

3
00:13:15,789 --> 00:13:21,789
After an all-night graduation beach party, a group of hung-over students wakes up
under the blazing sun to find their numbers somewhat depleted.

4
00:17:41,052 --> 00:17:47,052
An enormous alien creature has burrowed down deep and anyone foolish enough to make contact
with the sand finds themselves at the mercy of a sea of flesh-eating tentacles.

5
00:22:06,315 --> 00:22:12,315
Will they ever be able to escape its carnivorous clutches?

