00:53:03,157 --> 00:53:09,157
Sand Castle is a 2017 American war drama film directed by
Fernando Coimbra and written by Chris Roessner.

13
00:57:28,421 --> 00:57:34,421
The film stars Nicholas Hoult, Logan Marshall-Green, Henry Cavill, Glen
Powell, Tommy Flanagan, Beau Knapp, and Neil Brown Jr.

14
01:01:53,684 --> 01:01:59,684
The film centers on Matt Ocre, a young soldier in the United States Army,
who is tasked with restoring water to a village in Iraq.

15
01:06:18,947 --> 01:06:24,947
It is inspired by Roessner's experience as a soldier in the Iraq War.

16
01:10:44,210 --> 01:10:50,210
It was released on April 21, 2017, on Netflix.

17
01:15:09,473 --> 01:15:15,473
The film explores themes of beach, sand, alien, stranded, eaten alive.

18
01:19:34,736 --> 01:19:40,736
The tone is lighthearted and dark and thought_provoking.
